### ArchScale Auth API - Local Testing Collection (Aligned with Technical Specification §10)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@superAdminToken = your_super_admin_jwt_token_here
@adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here
@subscriberToken = your_subscriber_jwt_token_here

### 1. Healthcheck (for Railway / Monitoring)
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 2a. Login with Username - Public
# @name loginWithUsername
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "CorrectPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 2b. Login with Email - Public
# @name loginWithEmail
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@archscale.in",
  "password": "CorrectPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 2c. Login with User ID (legacy fallback) - Public
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "superadmin",
  "password": "CorrectPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 3. Refresh Access Token (Cookie sent automatically by browser)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

### 4. Forgot Password - Public
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "superadmin@archscale.in"
}

### 5. Reset Password - Public
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token_from_email_or_console",
  "newPassword": "NewStrongPassword456!"
}

### 6. Get Current User & Permitted Context - Authenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberToken}}

### 7. Super Admin: Create Registration Invitation - Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lead_architect@studioexample.com",
  "tenantType": "studio_owner",
  "organizationName": "Metropolis Architecture Group",
  "membershipEndsAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "mode": "invite"
}

### 8. Super Admin: List Invitations - Super Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 9. Super Admin: Revoke Pending Invitation - Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/invitations/specific_invitation_id/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 10. Super Admin: Manual User Registration per §5.3 - Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "contractor@vendorexample.com",
  "userId": "contractor_mike",
  "fullName": "Mike Vance",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 11. Super Admin: Organization & Tenant Provisioning per §4.3 - Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Engineering & Design",
  "tenantName": "Acme London Studio",
  "tenantType": "studio_owner"
}

### 12. List Active User Device Sessions - Authenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberToken}}

### 13. Revoke Individual Device Session - Authenticated
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/sessions/specific_session_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberToken}}

### 14. Logout From All Devices - Authenticated
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberToken}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

### 15. List Organization Memberships - Super Admin / Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 16. Update / Revoke Membership Status - Super Admin / Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/memberships/specific_membership_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "revoked"
}

### 17. Logout (Current Device) - Authenticated
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberToken}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
